    "paletteSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/luqezr/eva-01-theme-vscode/364b354d6eacb612cff217578853dc30054f1954/eva-01-color-theme.json",
    "notes": "Nigecha Dame is an unofficial theme inspired by the color scheme of Evangelion Unit-01. Typie is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by the rights holders of Evangelion. The MIT license applies to the upstream theme author's contributions and does not grant rights to the referenced franchise. Dark only, matching the upstream offering. Original purple-black editor paper and lime link/cursor accent are retained. The canvas uses a stronger purple derived from the original status-bar purple (#734f9a). Body text stays neutral; ordinary secondary text, icons and hints stay lavender. Hover, active and subtle accent surfaces composite the upstream bright tab-hover green (#72ff00) over the paper at 20%, 30% and 12%. This preserves green selection while increasing chroma without requiring inverted selected text. Emphasized borders repeat the original lime. Editor selection uses the same brighter green at Typie's 30% overlay, deliberately replacing the original purple selection. Search/comments stay amber; review issue/strength stay purple/green. Editor ink hue families remain unchanged."
  },
